device 1 close
pre-erase off
label case asis
set postscript ppi 800
frame coordinates 10 10 98 98 
char size 1
label size 3
tic mark label size 3
char fill on
char circle 
lines blank dotted
xlimits 0 12
skip 25
read lnspcg.dat w z d
let wt = 1/w
weights wt
linear fit d w
x1label True Line Spacing, micrometers
y1label Measured - True Line Spacing, micrometers
device 2 postscript
plot  d pred vs w
device 2 close
system mv dppl1f.dat hetsc.ps
quit
